Source: pie-makefs
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Maxwell <maxwell@blueberrypieos.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), libbsd-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.3
Homepage: https://github.com/blueberrypieos/pie-makefs
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/blueberrypieos/pie-makefs.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/blueberrypieos/pie-makefs
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: pie-makefs
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: create a ZFS pool image from a directory tree
 FreeBSD's makefs with only its zfs writer, installed as
 /usr/bin/pie-makefs. It writes a pool and its datasets from a directory
 tree without the ZFS kernel module. With a fixed -T time, the same tree
 gives the same image.
